1
00:00:15,699 --> 00:00:25,100
Quality station: the part is raised to the wrist's eye-in-hand camera (inset) for inspection, then binned.

2
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:27,933
Functional test: a single extended finger presses the spring-loaded diagnostic button, confirmed by its sensor.

3
00:00:27,933 --> 00:00:32,933
Harness inspection: the hand elastically flexes the wiring cable while the 6-axis wrist force/torque sensor monitors load.

4
00:00:32,933 --> 00:00:42,233
Connector seating: the high-voltage connector is grasped, carried, and seated into its receptacle -- all through real contact.
